### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### PERMISSIONS API (AdminOnly)
### ============================================================

### List all permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get permission by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new permission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Content.Read",
    "description": "Read content permission",
    "provider": "Content",
    "action": "Read",
    "resource": "Article",
    "isSystem": false
}

### Update a permission
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Content.Read.All",
    "description": "Read all content permission"
}

### Delete a permission
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}
